{"title":"Career roadmap · Soil & Water Conservation Engineer","role":"Soil & Water Conservation Engineer","summary":"A Soil & Water Conservation Engineer plans, designs, implements, and monitors engineering measures that reduce soil erosion, water loss, land degradation, runoff, flooding, and sedimentation, while improving water availability for agriculture and rural development.","facts":{},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The work combines:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Soil science"},{"text":"Hydrology"},{"text":"Fluid mechanics"},{"text":"Surveying"},{"text":"Watershed management"},{"text":"Irrigation engineering"},{"text":"GIS/remote sensing"},{"text":"Hydraulic structures"},{"text":"Land-use planning"},{"text":"Environmental engineering"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A typical route is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Agricultural Engineering","Soil/Water/Watershed Internship","Field Engineer","Soil & Water Conservation Engineer","Senior Engineer","Watershed/Conservation Specialist","Project/Technical Manager"]}]},{"heading":"Career horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Target"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2027"},{"text":"Soil + water + agricultural engineering fundamentals"}],[{"text":"2027–2028"},{"text":"Hydrology, irrigation and erosion-control engineering"}],[{"text":"2028–2029"},{"text":"GIS + watershed modelling + field internship"}],[{"text":"2029–2030"},{"text":"Soil & Water Conservation / Watershed Engineer"}],[{"text":"2030–2033"},{"text":"Field design + watershed projects"}],[{"text":"2033–2036"},{"text":"Senior Conservation Engineer / Watershed Specialist"}],[{"text":"2036–2040"},{"text":"Project Manager / Technical Specialist"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Principal Engineer / Watershed & Natural Resources Consultant"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to build each year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Year","Build this","Key ski